      "intent": {
        "task": "Find the full real parameter set for nonexistence, including negative parameters and tangency endpoints.",
        "source_solution": "On x+y=6, x^2+y^2=18+(x-y)^2/2>=18. No solution iff r^2<18, equivalently -3sqrt2<r<3sqrt2. At either endpoint (3,3) is a solution; outside the interval there are two.",
        "unit_reason": "The complete parameter interval is the source task; neither positive-r restriction nor a single sampled value is sufficient.",
